e': 0.5774427652359009}, {'clip_163_168': 'clip_163_168', 'text': 'The sequence opens with an aerial establishing shot of **Odesa** (text visible in yellow at the bottom), showcasing a sprawling coastal city with dense residential blocks, greenery, and a curved shoreline along calm blue waters. The atmosphere appears hazy with overcast skies.\n\nThe scene then cuts to a static, ground-level view of an extremely **crowded beach** (maintaining the "Odesa" label) that holds for the remaining five frames. Hundreds of beachgoers in swimwear blanket the sand—sunbathing on colorful towels and lounge chairs, standing in groups, or wading at the water\'s edge. Prominent elements include large red-and-yellow inflatable structures floating near the shore, a white jet ski anchored at the waterline, and scattered umbrellas. The mood is **lively and bustling**, capturing peak summer leisure activity with a chaotic but relaxed vacation atmosphere. The frames from 164s to 168s show no discernible motion, suggesting a held still image or frozen moment of the crowded shoreline.', 'similarity score': 0.5738790035247803}, {'clip_410_422': 'clip_410_422', 'text': 'The sequence opens with a medium shot of a man in a cream-colored button-down shirt seated in a personal office or study (410s). Behind him, the wall displays eclectic decor: a multi-panel world map, a wooden California state silhouette, a decorative paddle, a license plate reading "375 KEB," and a colorful gecko decal.\n\nAt 411s, the video cuts to a static photograph that remains unchanged through 422s. The image depicts two shirtless heavyweight boxers—the Klitschko brothers (Wladimir and Vitali)—posing together in a gym setting. Both wear bright red boxing gloves (branded "LANGSDORF" on the left fighter and "TWINS" on the right). The boxer on the left drapes his right arm over the other\'s shoulder while both face the camera with serious expressions. The background shows gym equipment and a partially visible sign reading "